ational Effectiveness","Organizational Effectiveness","Commercial Performance","Technology & Systems","Scalability & Business Value"]},{"key":"k3_objective","label":"Strategic objective supported","type":"text","required":false},{"key":"k3_definition","label":"Metric definition, scope and calculation","type":"textarea","required":false},{"key":"k3_unit","label":"Unit of measure","type":"text","required":false},{"key":"k3_direction","label":"Desired direction","type":"select","required":false,"options":["Higher is better","Lower is better","Within defined range","Qualitative / manually assessed"]},{"key":"k3_baseline","label":"Baseline value","type":"number","required":false},{"key":"k3_baseline_date","label":"Baseline period / date","type":"text","required":false},{"key":"k3_target","label":"Target value","type":"number","required":false},{"key":"k3_current","label":"Latest actual value","type":"number","required":false},{"key":"k3_current_date","label":"Latest measurement date / period","type":"text","required":false},{"key":"k3_frequency","label":"Measurement frequency","type":"select","required":false,"options":["Weekly","Monthly","Quarterly","Per transaction / event","Other / defined below"]},{"key":"k3_owner","label":"Data owner / accountable KPI owner","type":"text","required":false},{"key":"k3_source","label":"System, report or evidence source","type":"text","required":false},{"key":"k3_status_notes","label":"Variance explanation, data quality and context","type":"textarea","required":false}]},{"id":"metric_4","title":"4. KPI / performance measure 4","description":"Define a measurable indicator with a consistent unit, scope, period and source. Leave unknown values blank rather than entering zero.","questions":[{"key":"k4_name","label":"KPI / measure name","type":"text","required":false},{"key":"k4_dimension","label":"Performance dimension","type":"select","required":false,"options":["Financial Performance","Operational Effectiveness","Organizational Effective